  "_changes": [
    "2026-11-18 UI pass follow-up: utilities autoroles gained bot_roles, delay_minutes, ignore_roles, require_roles (options the autoroles API already honoured); tickets: the old details modal and table (11 ids) were replaced by the cfk-tk-* viewer on /api/guilds/:id/tickets (gap wave 1).",
    "2026-11-18 kit-drift review: utilities gained the autoroles option ids (#autoroleBotRoles, #autoroleDelay, #autoroleIgnore, #autoroleRequire) and the member backfill controls (#arBackfillStart, #arBackfillStop, #arBackfill-status, #arBackfill-label; /api/guilds/:id/autoroles backfill); tickets lost the old details modal's inline handlers (assignTicketFromModal, closeTicketDetailsModal, closeTicketFromModal, submitTicketNote, transferTicketFromModal) with the modal itself (replaced by the cfk-tk-* viewer).",
    "2026-11-19 custom-command storage (H-648): custom-commands gained the Storage reference card (#ccxStorage, #ccxStorageTitle) listing the {db:...}/{sdb:...} tokens.",
    "2026-11-19 dashboard accuracy pass: tickets Default panel gained the Log channel select (#ticketLogChannel, field log_channel_id): the column /support ticket setup sets and closed-ticket logs fall back to; POST update-tickets now writes only the columns sent (dashboard/services/ticket-config-save.js).",
    "2026-11-19 final-a (H-681): utilities temporary voice channels gained an on/off switch (#tempChannelsEnabled, field enabled, with #tempChannelsEnabled-desc) and the hidden enabled_sent marker; POST update-tempchannels turns them off when the switch is unticked (core/temp-channel-config.js, the same state /admin temp-channel disable changes).",
    "2026-11-19 final-b (H-714): tickets gained the alert channel: the Default panel form posts alert_channel_id (#ticketAlertChannel, #ticketAlertChannel-desc; ticket_config.alert_channel_id, migration 452) and the panel dialog has #alert_channel_id (ticket_panels.alert_channel_id), so the New Ticket Opened post can be turned on."
  ]
}
